    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# 👉  SETUP\n\n1. Get your GHL Private Integration Key and Location ID. Add to the \"Get Custom Field ID V2\" node.\n\n2. Click on \"Execute Workflow\", selecting \"from Manual\" to Get your custom field IDs for \"Magic Link\" and \"Demo Context\". \n\n3. Add custom field IDs to first node \"Edit Fields\", along with your Private Integration Key. \n\n5. Add your Gemini API Key to the \"Demo Context AI\" AI node.",
